abstract: >-
  Reproducibility release containing the RUSCUAV benchmark code, synthetic worlds,
  trained PPO weights, primary no-terminal and secondary operational-stopping
  per-episode results, planner outputs, provenance, final tables and figures,
  and the manuscript and supplementary material.
